
% I Knew You Were Trouble

In: I |
a: I | V | vi | IV |
PCh: I | V | vi | IV |
Vr: $a*2
b: vi | IV | V | I V |
b_drop: vi | IV | V | R |
Ch_drop: $b*3 $b_drop
DCh: $b*2
Ch: $b*4
bridge: IV | vi | IV | V |
b_end: vi | IV | V | I R |
PostCh: $b $b_end
S: [G] $In $Vr*2 $PCh $Ch_drop $DCh $Vr*2 $PCh $Ch $DCh $bridge $Ch $DCh $PostCh
